      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "VICI BLOOM (5) did a good job for a winning return after eight months on the sidelines, working to the front before going on to score by 5.7m at this circuit and distance. Draws a couple of spots wider but should strip fitter so can go on with it. LOCKSLEY CAVALIER (3) raced just once last campaign when third after covering ground here in June. That took his fresh record to two wins and two placings from five attempts. Draws well so look for another good showing. NAKEDTRUTH (7) has been freshened since she was stood down with a vet certificate last time but has won a trial in that time and had some decent form prior.",
